{"id":"wb-1-124","name":"留园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"留园","text":"留园是位于苏州的一个中国园林，园内有建筑以及奇石。1961年，留园被中华人民共和国国务院公布为第一批全国重点文物保护单位之一。1997年，包括留园在内的四座苏州古典园林被列为世界文化遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%95%99%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":92806784,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92806784","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a1fd58b9e190325b4e46ac02.jpg","title":"Lingering_Garden_8.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lingering_Garden_8.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/Lingering_Garden_8.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"钉钉","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Lingering Garden","width":320,"height":240}}